<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.10.6">
<l>niṉṟa vāṟu mirunta vāṟuṅ kiṭanta vāṟu niṉaippariyaṉa</l>
<l>voṉṟalā vuruvā yaruvāyaniṉ māyaṅka</l>
<l>ṇiṉṟu niṉṟu niṉaikkiṉ ṟēṉuṉṉai yeṅṅa ṉaniṉai kiṟpaṉ pāviyēṟ</l>
<l>koṉṟunaṉ kuraiyā yulaka muṇṭa voṇcuṭarē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Of your wondrous deed that are formless, [you] being an unmeasured form that is one,</l>
<l>that are difficult to think for the way [you] stood, sat and lied</l>
<l>I constantly, constantly think. How can I think you? Well tell</l>
<l>me sinner one thing, o bright glow who swallowed the world.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
